<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A4.SS3" title="In Appendix D Prompts ‣ Appendices ‣ CaRT: Teaching LLM Agents to Know When They Know Enough" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D.3 </span>Prompts for termination model</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></nav>
